    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im looking into some natural ways to help with my mood lately because i havent been feeling great. i was thinking about starting st johns wort but i am currently on the pill (combined birth control) and wanted to check if that's okay to do together?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "No, you should not take St. John's wort while on the combined birth control pill because it can reduce the pill's effectiveness and increase the risk of unintended pregnancy. Additionally, taking St. John's wort with other medications can cause unpredictable chemical changes in your body that may lead to serious side effects. It is safest to consult with your healthcare provider before starting any new supplements, especially those that interact with hormonal contraception, so they can recommend the right natural or medical approach for your mood.",
