    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know it's better to talk to a doctor but i really dont want to deal with the hassle of an appointment right now lol. is it really that big of a deal? like i've heard some people say it's fine as long as you don't take huge doses. like if i just take a standard daily dose would it still mess with my BC?",
