      "content": "Even a standard daily dose of St. John's wort significantly decreases the effectiveness of the combined birth control pill by speeding up liver metabolism. Since this interaction can happen unpredictably, there is no safe \"standard dose\" you can take alongside hormonal contraception without risking an unplanned pregnancy. Given the serious consequences of failure, skipping the appointment is risky, and I strongly recommend waiting until you speak with a doctor to ensure your safety.",
